OL,3,GNEWSASeven planes searched after
OL,4,Asuspected bomb threats across Europe
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeven flights have been searched after
OL,7,Flanding in Europe, following a series
OL,8,Fof bomb threats
OL,10,FTwo Ryanair planes were searched after
OL,11,Flanding in Rome, with one - a flight
OL,12,Ffrom Dublin - escorted by the Italian
OL,13,FAir Force
OL,15,FAnother two flights were inspected in
OL,16,FWarsaw, including one that had set off
OL,17,Ffrom London Heathrow - while another
OL,18,Ftwo landed in Sofia
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
